description=Modul gabungan (thermal + gaming) untuk kelancaran FPS di Xiaomi Mi 9 (cepheus/sm8150). SAAT GAME: lepas throttle thermal userspace (pause mi_thermald + reset cooling & clamp CPU) + GPU floor. Di LUAR game thermal berjalan normal. Plus I/O deadline & VM. Aman bareng Encore Tweaks (CPU governor/cpufreq diurus Encore).
